architecture account-peer-connections
  source_lineage earliest source cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/profile_site_scope.test.mjs first committed 2026-11-05 in 44c1481e "feat: land Aug 24 - Nov 5 native estate work"
  canonical_name AccountPeerConnections
  family surface
  domain Profile / Private introductions
  layer surface
  semantic_question How can people find common interests and introductions without turning a public profile into participation?
  purpose Connects a signed-in person to separately chosen social contexts, source-owned public profile material and the private Participation owner.
  maturity implemented
  source_path cmd/BonfyreParticipation/src/peer_facets.c
  source_path cmd/BonfyreParticipation/src/peer_facets.h
